| **Automated log understanding** | Eliminates manual log parsing across vendor formats |
| **Event normalization** | Creates a single source of truth across multi-vendor environments |
| **Timeline reconstruction** | Provides accurate, clock-skew-corrected event chronologies |
| **Causal analysis** | Identifies cause-effect relationships with quantified confidence |
| **Root cause detection** | Pinpoints initiating triggers, reducing investigation time from hours to minutes |
| **Causal chain extraction** | Reveals complete propagation paths for understanding failure cascades |
| **Incident summarization** | Generates natural language explanations accessible to all stakeholders |
| **Visualization and reporting** | Produces interactive dashboards and formal reports for operations and audit |

By combining retrieval-augmented generation, pattern extraction, graph-based causal reasoning, and large language models, the platform enables faster, more accurate, and more consistent investigation of complex network incidents — reducing mean time to resolution (MTTR) and improving network reliability.

